### L21.S2 · [D] · Rose, Julian
*Purpose: Monday's ledger — the week's position; twenty-two seven thirty-six, thirty-six five hundred; the stated. (Turns: 8)*
> *(The war room, Monday morning. Julian has the week's position laid out — the figures, the remaining paper — and the arithmetic sits between them like a third party at the table.)*
> "Twenty-two thousand, seven hundred and thirty-six." Julian taps the ledger. "The venture's cash, to the pound. Face reclaimed — thirty-six thousand five hundred. Outstanding — the same."
> (T1 · look closer) *The columns stand plain in the morning light — and the week's campaign fits in three numbers.*
> "And the Dealing." Rose doesn't sit. "Fifteen thousand — untouched since the season began. Plus whatever Rackham kept back and traded. That's the week's parcel, Julian."
> (T2 · tone) *Brisk, businesslike, and done with preamble — Monday has the offer coming and no time for pretty talk.*
> "The Dealing." He turns a page. "Fifteen thousand of Hartwell face, Rackham's own dealing. And the retained —" he checks his notes "— six thousand, by the broker's old reckoning. Twenty-one thousand in one hand."
> (T3 · dialogue) *"Twenty-one thousand, one hand."; "The Dealing's fifteen."; "The retained's six."*
> "One hand." She crosses to the map. "Rackham's hand, Julian. The broker was his man — unnamed all through the half's closing, and faithful. Today he names himself."
> (T4 · stance) *At the map, back to the room — the week's parcel marked in red, the broker's road traced in pencil.*
> Julian closes the ledger. "A named broker, Rose, is a different animal from an unnamed one. Names can be sued. Names can be —" he pauses "— answered."
> (T5 · look closer) *The counsel's caution is the law's kind: stated once, and left to work.*
> "Then we'll answer him." She turns. "The offer comes today, Julian. Fourteen thousand, the whisper says — and something that isn't money."
> (T6 · dialogue) *"The whisper says fourteen."; "The something, unpriced."; "The answer, ready."*
> "Fourteen thousand for twenty-one thousand face." Julian does the sum aloud. "Two-thirds. The discount's the acknowledgment's, Rose. Price it carefully."
> (T7 · choice) *Price the unpriced. The week's art is in the part that isn't pounds.*
> The war room settles. Outside, the City's already at its roar — Monday, and the money awake.
> (T8 · remembered micro-decision) *The figures filed, the counsel warned — the week's ledger opened, the offer awaited.*
> *The morning on the war room's table — twenty-two seven thirty-six, thirty-six five hundred. The arithmetic stated, the week begun.*
